<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">2 Timote</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timote</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Timote</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timote</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Timote</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kai Pawl, Khrih Jisuh thung kaawm e hringnae hoi kâkuen e lawkkamnae patetlah, Cathut ngainae lahoi Jisuh Khrih e guncei lah kaawm e ni, ka lungpataw e ka ca Timote koe ca na patawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maimae Bawipa Khrih Jisuh hoi Pa Cathut koe e lungmanae, pahrennae hoi lungmawngnae teh nang koe awm lawiseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mintoenaw ni a bawk awh e Cathut e lungmanae teh ka pholen. Karum khodai ka ratoum navah nang teh na pahnim hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na mitphi, kai ni ka pouk navah lunghawinae hoi na kawi thai nahanlah nang hoi kâhmo han dikdik ka doun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na minpui Lois hoi na manu Euniki ni yuemnae hmaloe a tawn teh, atu nang nihai yuemnae na tawn tie teh ka panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, kai ni kut na toung sin e lahoi Cathut ni poehno na poe e hah bout na kâtahrue nahan na thai sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cathut ni takinae muitha na poe hoeh, taranhawinae, lungpatawnae hoi mahoima kâcakuep thainae muitha doeh na poe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hatdawkvah Bawipa e lawkpanuesaknae dawk kayak hanh, ahni kecu thongim ka bawt e kai hai kayakkhai hanh, Cathut e kamthang kahawi dawk khang thai hringnae ma tawn haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cathut ni teh amae tami roeroe lah coung nahanelah na rungngang teh na kaw awh. Hot teh maimae tawksak thainae dawk nahoeh, amae na pahren lungmanae dawk doeh. Atue kamtawng hoehnahlan, lungmanae teh Khrih Jisuh thung na poe tangcoung e lah ao toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hateiteh atu angnae teh maimae rungngangkung Jisuh Khrih a tho e dawk talai tami pueng koe a kamnue sak. Duenae a raphoe teh hringnae kamthang kahawi hoi angnae koe a sin toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hete kamthang kahawi hramkhai hanelah thoseh, Jentelnaw kacangkhaikung lah thoseh Cathut ni na rawi toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hot kecu dawk hete roedengnae khang awh. Hatei, khoeroe kayakkhai hoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka yuem e Cathut teh ka panue. Ama koe ka poe e hah hote hnin totouh, Bawipa ni a khetyawt thai tie ka ngaiuep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kai ni na cangkhai e Khrih Jisuh thung kaawm e yuemnae hoi lungpatawnae hah khetsin hanelah kacaklah kuen loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maimae thung kaawm e Kathoung Muitha thaonae hoi na kut dawk poe lah kaawm e thaw kahawicalah tawk loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asia ram dawk kaawmnaw ni kai teh na pahnawt awh toe tie hah na panue toe. Ahnimanaw dawkvah, Phygelus hoi Hermogenes hai ao roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Onesiphorus ni lung pou na hawi sak dawkvah Cathut ni a imthung koe yawhawinae poe naseh. Sumbawtarui hoi ka o e heh ka kayak khai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rom kho a pha toteh kai na hmu hoehroukrak na tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hote hnin dawk Cathut koehoi a lungmanae a hmu thai nahanelah, Bawipa ni poe lawiseh. Hahoi, kai hanlah banghloimaw Efisa kho dawk thaw na kabawp teh na khetyawt tie hah na panue.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka ca, nang teh Khrih Jisuh thung kaawm e lungmanae lahoi kacaklah awm loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kapanuekkhaikung moikapap ao e patetlah kai koe na thai tangcoung e naw hah, yuemkamcu niteh alouke tami bout ka cangkhai thai hane naw koe patuen poe loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jisuh Khrih e ransa kahawi lah kai hoi reithai khang van loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ransa thaw ka tawk ni a bawipa e lawk a tarawi e patetlah talai koe lah na lung pen hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Yawng kâtânae dawk ka yawng e ni a phunglam patetlah yawng hoehpawiteh, bawilukhung hmawt mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Law ka sak nihai hmaloe a patang torei doeh a tawk na phu a ca van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka dei e lawknaw pueng Bawipa ni panuenae na poe e hoi kahawicalah pakhingpalang loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Devit catoun duenae koehoi kathaw e Jisuh Khrih kong heh pahnim awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kamthang kahawi kecu dawk tamikapo patetlah na hmu awh, na man awh teh na katek awh. Hateiteh Cathut lawk teh katek thai awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hatdawkvah rawi lah kaawm e naw teh Khrih Jisuh thung kaawm e rungngangnae hah yungyoe bawilennae hoi cungtalah a hmu thai awh nahanelah kai ni ahnimouh hanelah bangpueng ka khang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hetteh yuemkamcu e lawk doeh, ama hoi dout awh pawiteh ama hoi rei hring awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama hoi panguep awh pawiteh ama hoi cungtalah rei uk awh han. Na pahnawt pawiteh na pahnawt awh van han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maimouh ni yuem awh hoeh nakunghai Bawipa teh yuemkamcu dawkvah, amahoima kâpahnawt thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa hmalah cungkeihoehe kâoun rumram e naw hah kâhruetcuetnae poe haw. Kâounnae ni hnokahawi thokhai hoeh, kâraphoenae dueng doeh a thokhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang teh Cathut hmalah yuemkamcu e tami lah na o teh lawkkatang hah kahawicalah kapek thai e, a taran kahawi e thaw katawkkung buet touh lah na kâhmoun thai nahan panki loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cathutlaipa e pathunae lawknaw hah roun loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cangkhai payonnae teh a hmâ hoe kalensakkung lah ao. Himenaias hoi Philetus teh cangkhai payon dawk a kambawng roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahnimanaw ni lawkkatang lamthung a phen awh teh, kadout tangcoungnaw yo a thaw awh toe telah a dei awh dawkvah, tami tangawn e yuemnae a payon sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hateiteh, Bawipa ni amae taminaw hah a panue. Bawipa min kampangkhai e taminaw teh hno kahawihoehe roun han tie hoi tacikkin lah kaawm e Cathut e im du teh a cak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kalen e im dawk sui, ngun, thing, talai hoi sak e aphunphun ao teh bari e hno hoi barihoehe hno hai ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, ka dei tangcoung e patetlah kahawihoehe pahnawt vaiteh, barinae, kathoung niteh imkung ni hno hane kawi lah o han a ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nang teh nawsainaw ni raduek e roun nateh, lannae, yuemnae, roumnae, lungpatawnae naw hah kacaklah poe kuen loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathunae lawk kâpaceinae niteh kâyuekâounnae doeh a tâcokhai tie panuek nateh roun loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawipa e a san teh ayâ hoi lawk pungnae tawn mahoeh, alouknaw koe pahrennae ka tawn e hoi, Lung kasawe tami lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama ka tarannaw koe lawkkanem hoi cangkhai a ngai. Lawkkatang a dâw nahanelah Cathut ni lung kâthungnae a poe hai a poe yawkaw han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hahoi, kahraimathout ni a ngainae patetlah a man e taminaw ni a kâpanue vaiteh, hote mannae dawk hoi a hlout hai a hlout awh han doeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A hnukteng e hnin toteh atueng kathoute a tho han tie hah panuek loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangtelamaw tetpawiteh, amahoima lungkapatawe, tangka ka hounloun e, ka kâoup e, ayâ dudamnae lawk ka dei e, ayâ min mathoe ka poe e, manu na pa lawk ka ngâi hoeh e, hawinae ka panuek hoeh e, ka thoung hoeh e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />pahrennae ka tawn hoeh e, tami ka hmuhma e, tami ka tacuek e, amahoima kâcakuep thai hoeh e, ka pahngawpahrak e, tami kahawinaw lungpataw hoeh e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />lawkkam ka cak hoeh e, lawk ka ngâi hoeh e, lunglenpansa lah kaawm e, Cathut lungpataw hlak hnopai tawnta hoe lungpataw e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cathut thaw ka ngai e patetlah ao eiteh Cathut thaw dawk onae hah ka pahnawt e lah ao awh han. Hot patet e taminaw hah roun loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh ahnimouh thung dawk e tami tangawn teh, imnaw dawk arulahoi a kâen awh teh, radueknae aphunphun hnuk a kâbang awh teh, yon toungloung toungloung ka sak e napui kaponaw hah a man awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hote napui kaponaw teh pou a kamtu eiteh nâtuek hai lawkkatang panuek thai awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jannes hoi Jambres ni Mosi a taran roi e patetlah ahnimanaw hai lawkkatang hah a taran awh. Ahnimouh teh a lungthin a kamko toung dawkvah ka yuem e patetlah a kâsak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahnimanaw teh bout thaw thai awh mahoeh toe. Bangkongtetpawiteh ahnimae pathunae teh ahnimouh roi e pathunae patetlah tami pueng e hmalah a kamphawng han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hatei, nang teh kaie cangkhainae, o angnae, pouknae, yuemnae, lungsawnae, lungpatawnae, panguepnae dawk hai thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Antiok kho, lkonium kho hoi Listra khonaw dawkvah ka kâhmo e rektapnae hoi rucatnae dawk hai thoseh, nangmouh hoi pou ka o. Hot patet e rektapnae hah kai ni ka khang ei, hotnaw pueng dawk hoi Bawipa ni na hlout sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Atangcalah, Khrih Jisuh thung cathutlae khosaknae ka ngai e tami pueng teh rektapnae a khang han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw hoi tami ka dumyen e naw teh ayânaw hai a dum awh teh, ama hai a kâdum awh teh hoe ka mathout e kamkonae koe hoehoe a bo awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang teh, nama ni na kamtu teh kacaklah na yuem e dawk awm loe. Bangkongtetpawiteh, nang teh hote hnonaw hah api koehoi maw na kamtu tie hai thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khrih Jisuh thung yuem e lahoi rungngangnae hmu thainae hah lungangnae nang na ka poe thai e Kathounge, Cakathoung hoi nangmanaw ca hoi na kahnai e hai thoseh, na panue toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cakathoung dawk a thut e pueng teh Cathut ni kâha a poe e a tho dawkvah, cangkhai nahanelah thoseh, yon pâpho pouh nahanelah thoseh, payon e palan pouh nahanelah thoseh, lannae cangkhai hanelah thoseh, kahawipoung e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Het hateh, Cathut e tami ni hnokahawi alouklouk a sak thai nahanlah ka kuep e tami lah ao thai nahane doeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ama hoi a uknaeram a kamnuenae tueng toteh, kadoutnaw hoi kahringnaw lawk ka ceng hane Cathut hoi Bawipa Jisuh Khrih hmalah kai ni nang hah kâ na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lawk hah pâpho hanelah coungkacoe awm haw. Atueng o hai, ao hoeh hai thoseh, panki nateh pâpho haw. Lungsaw laihoi cangkhai nateh hroecoe, yue, thapoe loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ato hmalah teh taminaw ni kathounge cangkhainae ngai awh laipalah, a hnâ pathak awh vaiteh, amamouh ni a ngai awh e patetlah saya moikapap hnuk a kâbang awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lawkkatang tarawi awh laipalah, lairuipakong tarawi awh vaiteh, lam a payon awh han toe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang teh, bangpueng dawk kâhruetcuet loe. Rucatnae hah panguep loe. Evangelist ni a tawk hane kawi hah tawk loe. Na tawk hane thaw hah thouk tawk loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, kai teh thuengnae khoungroe van thueng lah ka o toe. Ka due nahane tueng a pha toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kâtuknae teh kahawicalah ka tuk toe. Yawng hane lamthung hai apout totouh ka yawng toe. Yuemnae hai ka kuep sak toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Atuvah lannae bawilukhung ni sut na ring toe. Hatnae hnin dawkvah, hmantang lawkcengkung Bawipa ni kai hah na poe han. Hothloilah, a kamnuenae ka lungpataw pueng koehai a poe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kai koe karang tho hanlah panki loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Demak teh atu e talaivan hringnae a lungpataw dawkvah, kai na pahnawt teh Thesalon kho lah a yawng toe. Kresen hai Galati ram lah a cei. Titu teh Dalmatia ram lah a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Luk dueng doeh kai koe kaawm. Mark hah thokhai haw loe. Bangkongtetpawiteh, thaw ka tawk navah na kabawmkung kahawipoung lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Taisikas hai Efisa kho lah ka patoun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hahoi, Troas kho Kapulet im ka ceitakhai e angki, cakalawng, hoi alawkpui lah phaivuen cauk hah pahnim laipalah uren thokhai lah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sum ka dêi e Alexander niyah kai dawk kahawihoehe hno thouk a sak. Bawipa ni a sak e patetlah pathung lawiseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang hai ahni hah kâhruetcuet loe. Bangkongtetpawiteh ahni ni kaimae lawk hah puenghoi a taran toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kai yon na pen awh e ka deicai pasuek navah, apinihai na kambawngkhai hoeh. Taminaw pueng ni na pahnawt awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahnimouh dawk Bawipa ni yon pen nahanh seh. Tami pueng ni na ka pahnawt nakunghai, kamthang kahawi Jentelnaw koe ka pâpho thai nahanelah doeh. Cathut teh kai koe lah a kampang dawk thaonae hoi na kawi sak. Sendek e pahni dawk hoi na hlout sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hot dueng nahoeh, Bawipa ni kahawihoehe pueng koehoi na hlout sak toe. Amae kalvanlae uknaeram totouh na hrawi han tie ka panue. Hote Bawipa teh a yungyoe hoi a yungyoe pholennae awm lawiseh. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Priscilla hoi Aquila, Onesiphorus e imthungnaw kut man loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Erastas teh Kawrin kho dawk a o. Trophimus teh a pataw dawkvah Miletus khopui dawk ka ceitakhai .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kasik thapa a pha hoehnahlan na tho thai nahane kâyawm. Ubulas, Puden, Linus, Kalaudia hoi hmaunawnghanaw pueng ni nang teh kut na man awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa Jisuh Khrih teh nange muitha hoi rei awm lawiseh. Nang dawk Cathut lungmanae awm lawiseh. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
